        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_03",
      "hash64": "8968E3ACA93B2A0D",
      "text": "¡Je! Sabía que tu curiosidad te llevaría a morder\\nel anzuelo y venir a verme.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_04",
      "hash64": "8968DCACA93B1E28",
      "text": "¡Mentir está muy feo! Sé lo mucho que te pica la\\ncuriosidad, chaval[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ínina; lo llevas escrito en la cara.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_05",
      "hash64": "8968DDACA93B1FDB",
      "text": "Un caldero, una espada, un juego de tablillas\\ny unos abalorios: cuatro tesoros que redujeron\\r\\nel castillo del rey a escombros...\\c\\n¿Pero qué ocurrió exactamente?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_06",
      "hash64": "8968DEACA93B218E",
      "text": "Resulta que esos objetos eran, en realidad,\\n¡Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_07",
      "hash64": "8968DFACA93B2341",
      "text": "Estos cuatro Pokémon, confundidos con riquezas,\\nhabían ido absorbiendo la codicia y el rencor de\\r\\nlos humanos mientras pasaban de mano en mano.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_08",
      "hash64": "8968D8ACA93B175C",
      "text": "La avaricia del rey fue la gota que colmó el vaso.\\c\\nEn cuanto cayeron en su poder, se transformaron\\nen calamidades y comenzaron a sembrar el caos.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_09",
      "hash64": "8968D9ACA93B190F",
      "text": "El monarca, desesperado por proteger su reino,\\nmandó llamar a varios expertos en Pokémon de\\r\\ngran renombre.\\c\\nJuntos aplacaron la furia de las calamidades,\\nno sin antes librar una ardua batalla contra ellas.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_10",
      "hash64": "896BE6ACA93D64FD",
      "text": "Acto seguido, se dice que lograron sellar a las\\ncuatro en diferentes rincones de Paldea, donde\\r\\npermanecen encerradas a día de hoy.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_11",
      "hash64": "896BE5ACA93D634A",
      "text": "¿Y bien? ¿Qué te ha parecido la historia?\\n¿Te parece una tontería pensar que es cierta?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_12",
      "hash64": "896BE4ACA93D6197",
      "text": "¡Vaya, qué corazón tan poco soñador tienes![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_13",
      "hash64": "896BE3ACA93D5FE4",
      "text": "Je, je... Muy astut[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, sí, señor[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
